    "body": "I think you are right. Looking at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#content-models in more detail it's largely about that.\n\nHmm. Do you have any idea besides adding a sentence like \"xxx elements have private shadow tree content\" to all the relevant elements? A centralized list seems nicer, like the ones you mention, but I am not sure what section it would belong in.\n",
